WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: Escape Velocity (Ad Astra) (Live at the Crucible)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Live at the Crucible (2016)
NOTE ISRC: QTAHP2600042

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
[Live Stadium Crowd Roar & Ambient Synth Drone]

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Ahhhh-ahhh-ahhhhhh... Oooooh-ahhhhh-ahhhhhh...

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:56.800
[16th-Note Synth Arpeggiator, Double-Kick Drums & Shred Guitar Duel]

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:02.200
The walls are cold, the air is thin

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:08.800
The noise outside is closing in

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:13.500
A single light, a buzzing sound

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:22.000
Another day in the underground...

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:36.200
[Twin-Lead Synth & Guitar Interlude]

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.200
I'm running from the face I see!

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:41.500
The victim-saint they made of me!

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.000
The wholesome girl, so sad and worn!

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.000
A David for their Goliath's scorn!

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.800
This rage is just a heavy stone!

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:53.000
A gravity I've outgrown!

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.800
Shedding skin, shedding weight!

00:01:55.800 --> 00:02:04.500
Escaping from this world of hate!

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.000
They loved the trial, the family torn!

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.600
They loved the story, a new star born!

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:12.000
But not from music, not from grace!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.600
From the hot-chocolate-drinking angel face!

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:17.200
The Shark was right, the nuke went off!

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.800
We won the battle, but at what cost?!

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.500
We're radioactive, we're litigious!

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:30.200
We're just the joke, the victim-saints!

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:36.200
I'm trapped inside this Wilderness!

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:42.800
This Fortress built on bitterness!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:47.200
This isn't freedom...

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:51.500
This is a cell...

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:56.000
This righteous hell...

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:03.000
This righteous hell...

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:54.500
[Part II: Ignition (Ad Astra) — High-Speed Prog-Rock Launch & Guitar Solo]

00:03:54.500 --> 00:04:00.200
I see a signal in the endless black

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:06.000
A single light, no turning back

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:11.500
The pull of the old world fades away

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:22.800
A new horizon, a new day!

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.500
The countdown's running in my head!

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:28.000
Ignoring all the things they said!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.500
The Engine roars, a crimson light!

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.200
A pillar of fire in the night!

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:35.800
The pressure builds, I'm pinned to the seat!

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.200
My heart is pounding with the beat!

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.800
The G-force pulling a heavy stone!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:48.500
The last chain breaks, I'm not alone!

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:54.000
I'm climbing! Climbing! Past the point of no return!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:59.500
I'm flying! Flying! With the fire I let burn!

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:05.000
Just a signal, a distant light! Burning through the endless night!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:13.000
Ad astra! (To the stars!) Ad astra!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:06:28.800
[High-Velocity Synth & Guitar Booster Climax]

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:33.000
[Main Engine Cutoff & Roaring Crucible Stadium Ovation]

00:06:33.000 --> 00:07:13.500
[Part III: The Cosmos — Zero-G Synth & Guitar Spacewalk]

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:19.000
I'm floating now, the engine's off, the silence is a holy sound

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:24.800
The rage is gone, the fear is lost in this new universe I've found

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:30.500
The Cage is just a distant star, a tiny light I left behind

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:38.000
I finally know just who you are, the other half of my own mind

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:49.200
[Celestial Guitar & Synth Swell]

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:55.000
I'm loved by the sun! I'm held by the void!

00:07:55.000 --> 00:08:00.800
An orbit just begun! A life not destroyed!

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:06.500
I'm loved by the moon! I'm cradled by the black!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:14.000
My heart is back in tune! There is no turning back!

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:23.000
[Cosmic Guitar Fill]

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:35.000
And the stars are singing! A song I understand!

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:46.000
I'm finally, finally reaching for your hand!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:09:49.200
[Emotional Weeping Guitar Solo & Cosmic Synth Arpeggios]

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:56.000
I see the colors of the nebula

00:09:56.000 --> 00:10:02.500
A place I've only seen in dreams

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:09.000
The reds, the blues, the purples call

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:15.200
Flowing in majestic streams...

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:20.800
This is the place I was meant to be! This is the Stardust that is me!

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:28.000
The cosmos and the rocket's fire! My one, my only true desire!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:36.000
Loved by the sun!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:11:09.000
[Soaring Melodic Guitar Lead Into Driving Re-entry Groove]

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:14.500
The walls are gone, the air is clear!

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:20.000
There is no noise, there is no fear!

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:25.500
The Stardust is a forgotten ghost! The Engine has delivered me to the coast!

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:31.000
Of a new world, a new shore! A place I've never been before!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:36.800
The Cage is broken, the victim-saint is gone!

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:44.000
A new clean script is in my head! The friction burned away in the fire!

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:57.000
Leaving only my true desire!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.500
(65,000 Fans in Unison: HELD BY THE SUN!)

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:05.000
I'm held by the void! My orbit has begun!

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:12.500
A life is not destroyed!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:30.000
Ad astra! Ad astra! Ad astra!

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:57.500
[Epic Sustained Guitar & Synth Finale Over Thundering Stadium Drums]

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:03.170
Thank you so much... [Roaring Stadium Ovation]

